IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0048.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    05 STUDENT-FLAG       PIC X.
    05 CLNT-AGE           PIC 9(3).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 FEE-WAIVED         PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 SVC-CHARGE         PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 2200-CONCESSIONS
    DISPLAY "FEE-WAIVED=" FEE-WAIVED
    DISPLAY "SVC-CHARGE=" SVC-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
2200-CONCESSIONS.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN STUDENT-FLAG = 'Y' AND CLNT-AGE < 25
            MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVED
            MOVE 0 TO SVC-CHARGE
        WHEN CLNT-AGE >= 65
            MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVED
            MOVE 0 TO SVC-CHARGE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 4 TO SVC-CHARGE
    END-EVALUATE.
